================================================================================
IMPORTANT: THIS REPOSITORY CONTAINS NO THIRD-PARTY BINARIES
================================================================================

This repository is a "config-only" distribution: it ships EFI/OC/config.plist,
the ACPI SSDTs, documentation and scripts — and NO kernel extensions, no
OpenCore binaries and no UEFI drivers.

Therefore this repository carries no GPL source-provision obligation and is not
subject to NullMoth's PolyForm Noncommercial terms.

When you download third-party components yourself, note that:

  * YYavicWiFi.kext        - GPL-3.0-or-later, (C) 2026 Yusufcan Yavic
                             includes MediaTek firmware under MediaTek terms
  * VoodooI2C / VoodooPS2  - GPL-2.0, (C) Alexandre Daoud / Acidanthera
  * SimpleMtkBtFw          - GPL-2.0, (C) laobamac
  * Lilu, VirtualSMC, WhateverGreen, RestrictEvents, NVMeFix, BrightnessKeys,
    BlueToolFixup, OpenCore, drivers
                           - BSD-3-Clause, (C) Acidanthera / vit9696
  * AMFIPass, USBToolBox   - BSD-3-Clause, (C) Dhinak G.
  * ECEnabler              - MIT, (C) 1Revenger1
  * NullMoth NVIDIA driver - PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0, (C) NullMoth
                             NONCOMMERCIAL USE ONLY (installed into
                             /Library/Extensions, not part of any EFI)

See docs/04-许可证与归属.md for the complete attribution table.

macOS itself is (C) Apple Inc. and its EULA does not permit installation on
